cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use psgs, please cite it as below."
title: "psgs: project starter guide skill"
abstract: >-
  An agent skill that turns an idea into a documented project and builds it
  task by task with a multi-agent team (orchestrator, backend, frontend,
  researcher, checker, reviewer) on user-chosen models across hosts, with
  security checks built into every step and a pre-release audit.
type: software
authors:
